---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /
---
<h1>{{ site.title }}</h1>
<p class="lede">X readable archive。一条帖子保存成一页，打开后把这个页面地址发给微信好友即可。</p>
{% if posts.length %}
<ul class="index">
  {% for post in posts %}
  <li>
    <a href="{{ post.page_url | url }}">{{ post.title }}</a>
    <p class="byline">
      {{ post.author_name or "未知作者" }}
      {% if post.author_handle %} · @{{ post.author_handle }}{% endif %}
      {% if post.created_at %} · <time datetime="{{ post.created_at }}">{{ post.created_at_display or post.created_at }}</time>{% endif %}
    </p>
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
{% else %}
<p>还没有存档。</p>
{% endif %}
